  {
    overview:
      'The Asgarnia area covers the entire Kingdom of Asgarnia along with the island of Entrana, the Pest Control islands, and Troll Country.<br><br>Instances of areas in Asgarnia and underground areas with an entrance in Asgarnia will also be included.<br><br>Access to Catherby from White Wolf Mountain will be restricted and prevented through the use of magical barriers.<br><br>All transportation and teleportation via Charter Ships, Customs Officers, Gnome Gliders, Fairy Rings, Balloons and all other forms of transport will require you to have unlocked access to the area your destination is in.<br><br>The following travel options are restricted unless you have access to the appropriate area:<br><br>- The under-wall shortcut between Port Sarim and Draynor Village<br>- The rubble shortcut between Death Plateau and the Fremennik Province<br>- The cave between Trollweiss and Keldagrim<br>- The rock-climb shortcut between the Troll Stronghold and the Wilderness<br>- The rock-climb shortcut between the God Wars Dungeon and the Wilderness<br>- The ladder between Taverley Dungeon and the Water Obelisk<br>- The underground tunnel between Taverley and Catherby<br>- The cave between Entrana and the Wilderness<br><br>',
    keyInfo:
      "Notable Settlements:<br><br>- Burthorpe<br>- Ruins of Camdozaal<br>- Ice Mountain<br>- Dwarven Mine<br>- Entrana<br>- Falador<br>- Goblin Village<br>- God Wars Dungeon<br>- Port Sarim<br>- Rimmington<br>- Taverley<br>- Troll Stronghold<br>- Void Knights' Outpost<br><br>Notable combat-related activities:<br><br>- Asgarnia Ice Dungeon<br>- The Whisperer <br>- Cerberus<br>- Giant Mole<br>- God Wars Dungeon (with Nex)<br>- Taverley Dungeon<br>- Warriors Guild<br>- Pest Control<br><br>Notable non-combat activities:<br><br>- Crafting Guild<br>- Falador Rooftop Agility Course<br>- Falador Tree Patch<br>- Falador Allotment Patch<br>- Water Obelisk (with Kandarin unlocked)<br>- Fire Obelisk<br>- Heroes' Guild<br>- Motherlode Mine<br>- Rimmington House Portal<br>- Rogue's Den<br>- Mahogany Homes<br>- Mining Guild<br>- Air, Body, Law and Mind Altars<br>- Taverley House Portal<br>- Taverley Tree Patch<br>- Troll Stronghold Herb Patch<br><br>",
    unlocks:
      "The following quests and their pre-reqs are automatically completed but will not reward any completion XP:<br><br>- Cook's Assistant<br>- Sheep Shearer<br>- Restless Ghost<br>- Porcine of Interest<br>- Shield of Arrav<br>- Heroes' Quest<br>- Merlin's Crystal<br>- My Arm's Big Adventure<br>- Below Ice Mountain<br>- Dwarf Cannon<br><br>The following tasks in the Falador Achievement Diary are automatically completed:<br><br>Easy Tasks:<br>- Smith some Blurite Limbs on Doric's anvil<br><br>Medium Tasks:<br>- Visit the Port Sarim Rat Pits<br><br>Hard Tasks:<br>- Recharge your Prayer in Port Sarim church while wearing full Proselyte<br><br>Elite Tasks:<br>- Purchase a white 2-handed sword from Sir Vyvin<br><br>Additionally, you will be eligible to complete The Frozen Door, if you haven't already. It will not be auto-completed.<br><br>The following Combat Achievements are automatically completed:<br><br>- Tentacular<br>- The Worst Ranged Weapon<br>- The Bane of Demons<br><br>",
    drops:
      "The drops listed below are affected by the drop rate modifier perks granted by passive Relic unlocks.<br><br>Drop rates affected are always rounded down and are not tied to area unlocks. This list represents the key drops affected in Asgarnia.<br><br>- All Defenders from Cyclops<br>- All unique rewards from Cerberus<br>- All unique rewards from Kree'arra<br>- All unique rewards from General Graardor<br>- All unique rewards from Commander Zilyana<br>- All unique rewards from K'ril Tsutsaroth<br>- Dragon Boots from spiritual mages<br>- All unique rewards from Nex<br>- All unique rewards from The Whisperer<br>- All unique rewards from Superior Slayer Creatures<br>- Smouldering Stone from Hellhounds<br>- All unique rewards from the Royal Titans<br><br>",
  },
  {
    overview:
      'The Fremennik Province area covers the entire Fremennik Province (including the Fremennik Isles) along with Lunar Isle and Weiss.<br><br>Instances of areas in the Fremennik Province and underground areas with an entrance in the Fremennik Province will also be included.<br><br>Access to Kandarin via the bridge south of Rellekka will be blocked by magical barriers.<br><br>All transportation and teleportation via Charter Ships, Customs Officers, Gnome Gliders, Fairy Rings, Balloons and all other forms of transport will require you to have unlocked access to the area your destination is in.<br><br>The following travel options are restricted unless you have access to the appropriate area:<br><br>- The log shortcut leading to the Fremennik Province north of Sinclair Manor<br>- The rubble separating the Fremennik Province and the Death Plateau<br>- The Cave entrance in the tunnel leading to Keldagrim that leads to the bottom of Trollweiss mountain<br>- The basalt rock Agility shortcut leading from the Lighthouse to the Barbarian Outpost<br><br>',
    keyInfo:
      "Notable Settlements:<br><br>- Keldagrim<br>- Ghorrock Dungeon<br>- Lunar Isle<br>- Miscellania and Etceteria<br>- Neitiznot and Jatizso<br>- Rellekka<br>- The Island of Stone<br>- The Mountain Camp<br>- The Pirates' Cove<br>- Ungael<br>- Waterbirth Island<br>- Weiss<br><br>Notable combat-related activities:<br><br>- Basilisk Knights<br>- Duke Sucellus <br>- The Phantom Muspah<br>- Dagannoth Kings<br>- Rellekka Slayer Cave<br>- Waterbirth Island Dungeon<br>- Vorkath<br><br>Notable non-combat activities:<br><br>- Blast Furnace (operated by dwarves)<br>- Kingdom Management<br>- Penguin Agility Course<br>- Rellekka House Portal<br>- Rellekka Rooftop Agility Course<br>- Astral Altar<br>- Weiss Herb Patch<br><br>Ice Gloves will be provided upon unlocking this area and can be reclaimed from the Leagues tutor in Yama's lair if lost.<br><br>",
    unlocks:
      "The following quests and their pre-reqs are automatically completed but will not reward any completion XP:<br><br>- Secrets of the North (This does not complete DT1 and its pre-reqs)<br>- Horror from the Deep<br>- Dragon Slayer II<br>- Mountain Daughter<br>- Fremennik Trials<br>- Fremennik Isles<br>- Olaf's Quest<br><br>The following tasks in the Fremennik Diary are automatically completed:<br><br>Easy Tasks:<br>- Enter the Troll Stronghold<br><br>Medium Tasks:<br>- Mine some gold at the Arzinian Mine<br>- Travel to the Snowy Hunter Area via Eagle<br><br>Hard Tasks:<br>- Teleport to Trollheim<br><br>Elite Tasks:<br>- Kill the generals of Armadyl, Bandos, Saradomin and Zamorak in the God Wars Dungeon<br>- Slay a spiritual mage in the God Wars Dungeon.<br><br>- You will also automatically unlock the ability to make Super Antifire potions.<br><br>The following Combat Achievements are automatically completed:<br><br>- Versatile Drainer<br>- More Than Just a Ranged Weapon<br><br>",
    drops:
      "The drops listed below are affected by the drop rate modifier perks granted by passive Relic unlocks.<br><br>Drop rates affected are always rounded down and are not tied to area unlocks. This list represents the key drops affected in the Fremennik Province.<br><br>- Skeletal Visages from Vorkath<br>- Draconic Visages from all sources<br>- Dragonbone Necklaces from Vorkath<br>- Seers' Rings from Dagannoth Prime<br>- Mud Battlestaves from Dagannoth Prime<br>- Archer Rings from Dagannoth Supreme<br>- Seercull Bows from Dagannoth Supreme<br>- Warrior Rings from Dagannoth Rex<br>- Berserker Rings from Dagannoth Rex<br>- Dragon Axes from all sources<br>- Basilisk Jaws from Basilisk Knights<br>- Leaf-bladed Swords from all sources<br>- Leaf-bladed Battleaxes from Kurasks<br>- Brine Sabre from Brine Rats<br>- All unique rewards from Duke Sucellus<br>- All unique rewards from The Phantom Muspah<br>- All unique rewards from Superior Slayer Creatures<br><br><br>",
  },
