    keyInfo:
      "Notable Settlements:<br><br>- Gwenith<br>- Iorwerth Camp<br>- Lletya<br>- Prifddinas<br>- Tyras Camp<br>- Zul-Andra<br><br>Notable combat-related activities:<br><br>- A 'Rabbit'<br>- Iorwerth Slayer Dungeon<br>- The Gauntlet<br>- Zulrah<br><br>Notable non-combat activities:<br><br>- Enhanced Crystal Chest<br>- The Death Altar<br>- Lletya Fruit Tree Patch<br>- Prifddinas Allotment Patch<br>- Prifddinas Agility Course<br>- Prifddinas Crystal Implings<br>- Prifddinas Hunting Grounds<br>- Prifddinas House Portal<br>- Prifddinas Hardwood Trees<br>- Prifddinas Thieving<br>- Sacred Eel Fishing<br>- Zalcano<br><br>",
