    keyInfo:
      "Notable Settlements:<br><br>- Civitas illa Fortis<br>- Avium Savannah<br>- Cam Torum<br>- Ralos Rise<br>- Darkfrost<br>- Aldarin<br>- Twilight Temple<br>- The Stranglewood (accessable via a league navigator in northern Varlamore)<br>- Ruins of Tapoyauik<br>- Tlati Rainforest<br>- Tal teklan<br>- Crypt of Tonali<br>- Kastori<br>- Auburn Valley<br>- Auburnvale<br>- Custodia Mountains<br><br>Notable combat-related activities:<br><br>- Moons of Peril<br>- Fortis Colosseum<br>- Amoxliatl<br>- Hueycoatl<br>- Vardorvis<br>- Doom of Mokhaiotl<br>- Gemstone Crab<br>- Custodian slayer creatures<br><br>Notable non-combat activities:<br><br>- House robbery<br>- Calcified mining<br>- Blessed bone shards<br>- Hunter's guild with Hunter rumours<br>- Mastering Mixology Herblore activity<br>- Colossal Wyrm agility course<br>- Civitas Illa Fortis allotment patch<br>- Oasis Hardwood Tree patch<br>- Crafting Sunfire Runes<br>- Vale totems fletching<br><br>The following Varlamore shop stocks have been modified:<br>- Hunting crossbow at the Sunset coast charter ships.<br>- Throwing knives (up to Steel) at Arcuani's Archery Supplies<br>- Daggers and Halberds (up to Steel) at the Fortis blacksmith.<br><br><br><br>",
